Vendored JavaScript assets for `conspectus graph --format html` (ADR 0050).

These files are inlined into the generated HTML at build time via
`include_str!`. Updating any of them is a deliberate operator
action: refresh the file, update this VERSIONS file, and call out
the bump in the project changelog or commit message.

