    sha256: 1b060e1ffec6355e208d5ec4d49aa573000e8069eafbe01b1719a3bd630da290
    license: MIT (Cytoscape Consortium)
    note: dagre is bundled in this UMD build (cytoscape-dagre@3.x
          embeds dagre.cjs.js); no separate dagre.js needed.
          Does NOT self-register; driver.js calls
          `window.cytoscapeDagre(window.cytoscape)` explicitly.

Load order matters: layout-base → cose-base → cytoscape →
cytoscape-fcose → cytoscape-dagre. The Rust template inlines them
in that order so the UMD globals attach cleanly.

